CivicConnect is a civic grievance management platform for citizens, officers, and administrators.
Visit the deployed application:

    https://civicconnect-community.netlify.app

- Citizen Portal — submit and track complaints
- Officer Portal — manage assigned complaints
- Admin Portal — manage teams, reports, severity levels, and exports
- Interactive Ward Map
- Civic Helpline and Help Center
- Image evidence upload
- Duplicate complaint detection
- Complaint escalation workflow
This demo stores sample accounts and complaint data in the browser's local storage. Data may be reset when browser storage is cleared.
For first-time access, use the registration or demo-login options provided on the login screen.
